        "original_id": "deef3ef7-ea93-52c0-ab6e-ea84afdd6e52",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charles Hutchison, William K. Howard\n- Roles: actor, film director\n- Topics: film careers, Hollywood directing\n\nFacts:\n- Charles Hutchison appeared in 49 films between 1914 and 1944.\n- Charles Hutchison also directed 33 films between 1915 and 1938.\n- William K. Howard directed over 50 films from 1921 to 1946 and was considered one of Hollywood's leading directors.\n- William K. Howard's directing credits included The Thundering Herd (1925), The Power and the Glory (1933), Fire Over England (1937), and Johnny Come Lately (1943).",
